Description:</TD><TD>A suggestion that worked well for me.. Dont put any points in tailoring right away.  Buy up your weapon skills, etc first.  Save points from levels 2-4.  At level 4 put 15 points in tailoring, buy your kit and get to work on a set of patchwork.  You should succeed at a reasonable rate.  It also helps to collect as many pelts as you can before sinking the points in tailoring.
